            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I'm not sure how to do this without modifying the plugin code because I can't just copy it into the config since it uses `H` which is not exported.\n\nYou can write and set your own [`config.lsp_completion.process_lsp_items`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1bd64e3ce49964cdfa9ee0e84c56f42d53b89052/doc/mini-completion.txt#L218). If you need highlighting of item kind (which is what `H.make_add_kind_hlgroup()` is for), then you can copy [its definition](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1bd64e3ce49964cdfa9ee0e84c56f42d53b89052/lua/mini/completion.lua#L887-L904) (change usage of `H.kind_map` for custom `local kind_map` prior) into your config. Without comments it is fairly concise.",
